{"id":"7fea1eb1680edf84","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-smn.md","title":"S-m-n Lemma","display":"lem-smn — S-m-n Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-smn","aliases":["88-lem-smn"],"display":"lem-smn — S-m-n Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-smn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-smn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-smn — S-m-n Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\geq1\">\\(m,n\\geq1\\)</span> (arities)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\\)</span> (parameter-fixing predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> (Kleene equality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smn} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\n\\to\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\n\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smn} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\n\\to\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\n\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n^m\">\\(s_n^m\\)</span> : 总可计算的 s-m-n 参数固化函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> : 编号为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>的部分可计算函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 的定义来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>，不再只由 Remark 解释。</li>\n<li>递归定理的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (effective numbering, see [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)$ (parameter-fixing predicate, see [[88-df-smn-theorem]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\simeq$ (Kleene equality, see [[88-df-kleene-equality]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$s_n^m$ : 总可计算的 s-m-n 参数固化函数 (see [[88-df-smn-theorem]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ : 编号为$e$的部分可计算函数 (see [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\simeq$ 的定义来自 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]，不再只由 Remark 解释。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smn} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\n\\to\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\n\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)","display":true},{"tex":"s_n^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false}],"bytes":1141,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["1eb79833a139e232","b955b7851c500bfe","5f7e8cd4c12441fb"]}